da4linux (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * 10-stage DSP pipeline: FIR, PEQ, MB compressor, stereo enhancer,
    bass enhancer, dialogue enhancer, loudness compensation, virtual
    surround, output gain, limiter.
  * Supports Lenovo ThinkPad T14s Gen 2i (Realtek ALC257) with built-in
    profile. Extensible to any laptop via DAX3 XML tuning files.

 -- DA4Linux Project  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
